{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}
'''Group 2 of the 1978 FIFA World Cup''' was one of four groups of nations competing at the [[1978 FIFA World Cup]]. The group consisted of [[Poland national football team|Poland]], [[Germany national football team|West Germany]], [[Tunisia national football team|Tunisia]] and [[Mexico national football team|Mexico]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/78full.html |title=World Cup 1978 finals |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

